stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> pa_detected: PA email detected<br/>(Power Automate push or Graph poll)

    pa_detected --> task_created: Asana task upserted with<br/>name, description, delivery date,<br/>period (MMM YYYY), quote number

    state fork_tracks <<fork>>
    task_created --> fork_tracks

    note right of task_created
      THREE independent tracks.
      Only track 3 can reach the DRS, and it
      needs nothing from the PDFs.
    end note

    state "Track 1 - document pack - blocks NOTHING" as T1 {
        direction TB
        [*] --> pack_in_progress
        pack_in_progress --> pack_complete: signed quote, TAF, PO,<br/>master agreement in SharePoint
        pack_in_progress --> pack_partial: still missing after 72h<br/>flagged on the Asana task
        pack_complete --> [*]
        pack_partial --> [*]
    }

    state "Track 2 - amendment - blocks only the Order Type write" as T2 {
        direction TB
        [*] --> signed_quote_in
        signed_quote_in --> amendment_checked: executed quote PDF analysed
        amendment_checked --> [*]
    }

    state "Track 3 - enrichment and DRS - needs NetSuite only" as T3 {
        direction TB
        [*] --> so_enriched
        so_enriched --> ra_ready: Revenue Arrangement exists,<br/>RA number written to Asana
        ra_ready --> drs_done: TCV >= $250,000 USD<br/>workbook built and uploaded
        ra_ready --> no_drs_below_250k: TCV < $250,000 USD<br/>Review Signoff Threshold = "N/A"<br/>Preparer Status = "N/A - below threshold"
        drs_done --> [*]
        no_drs_below_250k --> [*]
    }

    fork_tracks --> T1
    fork_tracks --> T2
    fork_tracks --> T3

    T2 --> T3: soft link only - not a gate.<br/>If the DRS is built first it records<br/>amendment_status = not yet analysed,<br/>and affected cells are rebuilt later.

    state join_done <<join>>
    T1 --> join_done
    T2 --> join_done
    T3 --> join_done
    join_done --> [*]

    note left of T3
      The RA comes from a MANUAL daily job
      run by the revenue team, and only
      as-needed at month end. A case may
      sit in so_enriched for days.
      Do not alert on it.
    end note

    note right of T1
      No delivery notice exists any more
      (discontinued 14 Oct 2026).
      All documents are attached in
      Salesforce at Closed/Won, so this
      track is normally a single pass.
    end note
